#### Module Best Practices

| Pattern | Why |
| :--- | :--- |
| One main export per file | Easier to find, cleaner imports |
| Use named exports for utilities | Better tree-shaking, explicit about what you use |
| Barrel files (`index.js`) | Re-export from a folder's public API |
| Avoid circular imports | A imports B imports A → hard to debug, can cause undefined |
| Keep modules focused | A module should do one thing well |

